<title>RUSSIA: TABLE - Russian July unemployment falls to 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Russian July unemployment falls to 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia fell to 6.69 million or 9.3 percent of the workforce at the end of July from 6.89 million in June, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT		JUL 97     JUN 97     JUL 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)	6.69	 6.89	 6.73</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	    9.3	  9.5	  N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (million)  2.20	 2.30	 2.56</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
